# Line endings are LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Everything tracked is already LF in the index, and the byte-exact tests
# compare files against what Python's json.dumps writes, which is LF. Windows
# checkouts with core.autocrlf=true were converting files to CRLF on the way
# out, which failed those tests and Prettier's check. Pinning eol=lf removes
# the conversion, as the data repo does.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
